---
description: API HTTP layer — envelope, controllers, DTOs
globs:
  - apps/api/src/common/http/**
  - apps/api/src/**/*.controller.ts
  - apps/api/src/**/*.dto.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

# API — HTTP

- Envelope via `setupHttpContract()`; shared wire types from `@cabin/api-contract` — do not redefine the same contract in this app.
- Controllers return **domain objects only** — never wrap `{ data }` by hand.
- DTOs with `class-validator`. No bare `any` on controllers.
